8 08.11.2018 09.11.2018 10.11.2018 11.11.2018 12.11.2018 13.11.2018 14.11.2018 15.11.2018 16.11.2018 17.11.2018 After some years with laptops and docking station I got a desktop pc again. This time it is a HP Z600 Workstation - my first Xeon, workstation and dual-cpu machine. 18.11.2018 19.11.2018 20.11.2018 21.11.2018 22.11.2018 23.11.2018 24.11.2018 25.11.2018 26.11.2018 27.11.2018 28.11.2018 29.11.2018 30.11.2018 In our IB Physics lesson about oscillations we investigate the relationship between the length of a pendulum and it\u2019s period (frequency). The collected data is entered in a dataset at Kaggle and started to be analyzed by a Jupyter Notebook and Pandas. See https://www.kaggle.com/code/kreier/frequency-of-a-pendulum . More than 7 years later I remember my old Kaggle account and the chance to use the virtual Nvidia P100. I had planned to buy this GPU in 2025 for my Penta-GPU server i3-6100 . But there is no need! December 2018 01.12.2018 02.12.2018 03.12.2018 04.12.2018 05.12.2018 06.12.2018 07.12.2018 08.12.2018 09.12.2018 10.12.2018 11.12.2018 12.12.2018 13.12.2018 14.12.2018 15.12.2018 16.12.2018 17.12.2018 18.12.2018 19.12.2018 20.12.2018 21.12.2018 22.12.2018 23.12.2018 24.12.2018 25.12.2018 26.12.2018 27.12.2018 28.12.2018 29.12.2018 30.12.2018 31.12.2018 Graph View Table of Contents January 2018 February 2018 March 2018 April 2018 May 2018 June 2018 July 2018 August 2018 September 2018 October 2018 November 2018 December 2018 Backlinks 2026 My Diary Created with Quartz v4.5.2 \u00a9 2026 GitHub Discord Community",
